# Local secrets for `npm run dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars`, which is git-ignored.
# Nothing is required yet: sign-in, Turnstile, and report alerts arrive in
# later build steps. Real values belong in `wrangler secret put`, never here.

# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=replace-me.apps.googleusercontent.com
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=replace-me
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=replace-me
# REPORT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://example.com/replace-me
